						"collapsed": false,
						"entries": [
							"#### Update Solana dependencies to Agave 4.x\n_Packages:_ _wallet_standard_, _wallet_standard_browser_\n\nUpdate the Solana dependencies to the latest Agave 4.x crates, raise the MSRV to 1.89.0, and unify both crates on a single workspace version.\n\n_Owner:_ [@ifiokjr](https://github.com/ifiokjr) · _Review:_ [PR #44](https://github.com/pina-rs/wallet_standard/pull/44)"
						]
					},
					{
						"title": "Notes",
						"collapsed": false,
						"entries": [
							"#### Migrate release automation to monochange\n_Packages:_ _wallet_standard_, _wallet_standard_browser_\n\nReplace knope with monochange: a release PR flow on every push to main, crates.io trusted publishing through the `publisher` environment, and `release:local` / `publish:local` devenv scripts as a manual fallback.\n\n_Owner:_ [@ifiokjr](https://github.com/ifiokjr) · _Review:_ [PR #44](https://github.com/pina-rs/wallet_standard/pull/44)"
						]
					}
				]
